# Party banter while exploring Berez, Mount Baratok and the Tsolenka Pass. Each node opens with an `if` gate: the node
# is eligible only while its condition holds. Party members speak only through interjections.

~ banter_berez_nursemaid
if flag.berez_witch_met and not flag.lysaga_dead and not flag.lysaga_bargained and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:thistle
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: She was his nursemaid. Once he was only a baby in someone's arms, and somebody sang to him.
interject name:thistle: She said he had teeth already. Grandda says you can tell a biter from the first day.
endif
-> END

~ banter_berez_marina
if flag.marina_truth_known and not flag.strahd_knows_marina_truth and not flag.lysaga_dead and name:kip_smudgewick and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:kip_smudgewick: We know something about his own nursemaid that he doesn't. In trade, that's leverage. In Barovia, I think it's a lit fuse.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Tell him, and something horrible happens to someone horrible. Master Sorrel never covered that one. Shame. I'd have listened.
endif
-> END

~ banter_berez_told
if flag.strahd_knows_marina_truth and name:thistle and name:liriel_dawnsong
interject name:thistle: We told him. He'll go for her now. Good. She eats babies.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: I won't weep for her, dear heart. I won't call it clean, either.
endif
-> END

~ banter_berez_ireena
if flag.ireena_saw_marina and guest:ireena and (tag:cheerful or name:godrick_pendlebrook)
interject guest:ireena: Nine steps. I counted them before we got there. I don't remember learning to count them.
if tag:cheerful
interject tag:cheerful: Maybe you're just good at stairs.
else
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Maybe you're just very good at stairs, my lady. Some people are.
endif
interject guest:ireena: Thank you. That's the kindest wrong thing anyone's said to me in a month.
endif
-> END

~ banter_baratok_mage
if flag.mordenkainen_met and not flag.mordenkainen_restored and name:ratatoille and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:ratatoille: If that is who I think it is, the greatest wizard alive is up a mountain with twigs in his beard, arguing with birds.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Birds were winning, to be fair.
interject name:ratatoille: Non, non, non. Do not take the birds' side. I am having a crisis.
endif
-> END

~ banter_baratok_restored
if flag.mordenkainen_restored and not guest:mordenkainen and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Did you see his face when it all came back? He looked round for people who weren't there any more.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: He'll be insufferable now. Great wizards always are.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Then we shall bear it, Wren. We bear you.
endif
-> END

~ banter_mordenkainen_guest
if guest:mordenkainen and (tag:curious or name:thistle)
interject guest:mordenkainen: Stop looking at me as if I might wander off. I have my wits back. Most of them. The useful ones.
if tag:curious
interject tag:curious: Which ones are missing?
else
interject name:thistle: Which ones are missing?
endif
interject guest:mordenkainen: If I knew that, they wouldn't be missing, would they?
endif
-> END

~ banter_tsolenka_watch
if flag.tsolenka_watch_met and not flag.tsolenka_gate_open and name:godrick_pendlebrook and name:thistle
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Five of them, sergeant and all. Posts kept, mail oiled. Nobody came to relieve them, and they stayed. That's how the Order does it.
interject name:thistle: They're ghosts, Big. They don't even smell.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: I know. I'd stand a watch with them anyway, and be proud to.
endif
-> END

~ banter_tsolenka_gate
if flag.tsolenka_gate_open
interject tag:curious: "Nothing comes down." They kept that sign up for centuries. And we've just opened the gate.
if tag:curious
interject class:wizard: We've opened it going up. Whether anything comes down is, technically, a separate question.
endif
interject tag:blunt: Then we shut it behind us on the way back.
endif
-> END

~ banter_roc
if flag.roc_driven_off and name:ratatoille and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:ratatoille: It had a sword in its nest. Somebody marched up here armed to the teeth and became furniture. Bird furniture.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: I'll be walking in the very middle of the bridges, then. If nobody minds.
endif
-> END
